w: To Thee I call, on Thee re- ly.
w: I lift my voice and bring my plea,
w: With lift- ed hands at close of day,
w: * * * * * * * *
w: Though sent thro' foes, in love is sent;
w: To Thee my con- stant prayer shall rise;
w: O Lord, my God, in Thee I rest;
w: Their own de- feat my foes pre- pare;
